# .sync-ignore
#
# Files and directories listed here will never be overwritten
# by the sync-upstream-release workflow, even if upstream changes them.
#
# Rules:
#   - One path per line
#   - Supports glob patterns (e.g. home/shell/*.nix)
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#   - Directories: list as   some/dir   (matches some/dir and everything inside)
#
# Examples (uncomment to use):
#
# A specific file you've customised:
# home/shell/aliases.nix
#
# An entire directory you manage yourself:
# hosts/myhost
#
# All files of a certain type under a path:
# home/shell/*.nix
#
# Add your own below:
